## Offers awaiting your decision
1. Elizabeth Ellis offers 18 coins for 3 shovel to keep (offer id 16312) — you hold no shovels: accept, and you take payment now and owe Elizabeth Ellis 3 shovels you have yet to make
Respond with accept_pay, decline_pay, or counter_pay, passing the offer id as ledger_id and the words you speak aloud in say. Do not reply with the speak tool: speaking ends your turn, and the offer would go unanswered.
A counter changes only the price of the goods offered; it cannot add another good. To sell more than one kind of good together, offer them as one lot with sell instead, listing each good in lines — the lot then takes the place of this offer.
